meta {
  name: Order bKash Callback
  type: http
  seq: 8
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/orders/bkash/callback?paymentID=PAY1&status=success&signature=sig
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  Public browser redirect after a guest pays a delivery, takeaway or table QR order with the restaurant's bKash.
  No auth. status is success, failure, or cancel.
  A success redirect is not proof of payment: the API calls Execute with that restaurant's credentials and only then records one mobile payment.
  The response redirects to the frontend /track/{tracking_token}?paid=1 or /track/{tracking_token}.
  This is not the subscription callback at /billing/bkash/callback.
}
